# Line endings are part of the code for the launcher scripts, and GitHub serves the
# stored bytes to the installers and updaters. So Git must NOT convert them:
#   *.cmd / *.bat are stored with CRLF (cmd breaks labels and goto on LF-only files)
#   *.sh          are stored with LF   (bash breaks on CRLF)
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
*.sh  -text
